Z||000012||Robert||06-02-2000||12:52 AM||||This reminds me of a story not long ago in our local newspaper of two people learning how to drive using the parking lot at Candlestick Park (3COM Park) in San Francisco when the Giants were out of town.  Now I used to use this parking lot to test-drive my race bikes in the 60’s, so I know this lot goes on and on, with no poles or obstructions for as far as the eye can see.  Turns out these two managed to run into each other.  I just hope I never run into them on the freeway.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Robert<BR>||||reg||1
